# Citation metadata for the STRhub platform. GitHub reads this file for the
# "Cite this repository" button; Zenodo and bio.tools read it too. The journal
# article is under review: once it is out, add it here as `preferred-citation`.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use STRhub for teaching, academic discussion or research, please cite
  it using the metadata in this file.
type: software
title: "STRhub: Central Hub for Short Tandem Repeats"
abstract: >-
  Open-access, web-based platform for forensic short tandem repeat (STR)
  genetics: a catalogue of 228 STR markers with GRCh38 coordinates, ISFG
  sequence structures and population allele frequencies (capillary
  electrophoresis and sequencing), a DNA mixture simulator, an STR motif
  explorer, a FASTA generator, an embedded IGV viewer and educational
  articles in English, Spanish and Portuguese.
authors:
  - family-names: Frontanilla Recalde
    given-names: Tamara Soledad
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6873-7813
repository-code: https://github.com/Tfronta/strhub-web
url: https://strhub.app
license: AGPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - short tandem repeats
  - STR
  - forensic genetics
  - allele frequencies
  - population genetics
  - massively parallel sequencing
  - capillary electrophoresis
  - bioinformatics
  - education
